---
import DocsLinkCard from '@/components/docs/DocsLinkCard.astro';
---

<div class="mx-auto my-6 w-full max-w-3xl">
  <p class="mt-0">
    Packaged skins keep their controls and layout inside Video.js. When you need to add, remove, rearrange, or deeply
    restyle controls, use Shadcn to add the skin source to your project. Its components, layout, styles, and interactions
    become local files you can change.
  </p>

  <DocsLinkCard
    slug="guides/installation-shadcn"
    description="Add editable skin source and build a working React or HTML player"
    class="mx-0 mb-0 mt-5 max-w-none md:grid-cols-1"
  >
    Install Video.js with Shadcn
  </DocsLinkCard>
</div>
